<title>USA: Corrpro Cos Inc Q3 Dec 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Corrpro Cos Inc Q3 Dec 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEDINA, Ohio 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands, Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>	  For the Three Months Ended  For the Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				     December 31	  December 31</p>
<p>				 1996    1995	     1996     1995</p>
<p> Total Revenues	 $39,252 $36,109	 $116,441 $107,600</p>
<p> Unusual charges	     --     300	    2,400    1,800</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	1,480     715	    3,183  (3,474)</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>   per share		 0.22    0.11	     0.47   (0.57)</p>
<p> Weighted avg shares    6,794   6,716	    6,793    6,095</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q3 includes unusual charge of $300,000.</p>
<p>1996 nine months includes unusual charge for proposed shareholder litigation settlement.</p>
<p>1995 nine months includes unusual charge of $1.8 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
